### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### List Notes
GET http://localhost:8000/api/notes

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:8000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quantum Superposition & Qubits",
  "subject": "Physics",
  "content": "# Quantum Superposition\n\nIn quantum computing, a qubit can exist in a superposition of states |0⟩ and |1⟩.\n\nKey Properties:\n- Linearity of quantum mechanics\n- Measurement collapses the state\n- Entanglement creates correlated pairs",
  "tags": ["physics", "quantum", "computing"]
}

### AI Summarize
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ai/summarize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Machine learning algorithms build a mathematical model based on training data to make predictions or decisions. Supervised learning algorithms build a model of a set of data that contains both the inputs and the desired outputs. Unsupervised learning algorithms take a set of data that contains only inputs and find structure in the data, like grouping or clustering of data points."
}

### AI Flashcards
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ai/flashcards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Gradient Descent is an optimization algorithm used to minimize cost function J(w). Learning rate alpha controls step size. Too large alpha leads to divergence. Too small alpha leads to slow convergence.",
  "count": 3
}

### AI Quiz
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ai/quiz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Breadth-First Search (BFS) explores neighbor nodes first using a FIFO Queue. Time complexity is O(V+E). Depth-First Search (DFS) explores as deep as possible along each branch before backtracking using a LIFO Stack or recursion.",
  "num_questions": 3
}

### AI Study Tutor Chat
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Give me a quick mnemonic or memory trick to remember the difference between BFS and DFS queue vs stack behavior."
}

### Get Stats
GET http://localhost:8000/api/stats
